title: Tutorial
---

Jade: Ei?! What’s going on?

Jade: I am still in the shop. But it looks slightly different.

?: Detecting… beep…beep… Inside practice memory world. 

Jade: Who’ s that?!

Mem(appears): Welcome young memory restorer, I am Mem, your memory assistant.

Mem: Seeing that you are new to this, let me guide you through the restoration.

Mem: In the memory world there are forgotten areas(camera shift to fog covered study) covered in fog. 

Mem: Your ultimate goal is to restore it back. 

Mem: To restore, you will need to find memory fragments and memory echoes. 

Mem: The former will tell you more about the memory while the latter will help you in the memory world.

Mem: See that shining object there. Let’s investigate.(Then walk near a fragment( the photograph)),/ 

Jade: It’s a photo of a family. That child… It looks like me when I was young. 

Jade: Then those 2 are my parents?

Mem: press Key to collect fragments. It will tell you the memory behind it.

